    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #359\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nPushed the formatting fix commit to branch `bb/relay-237-notifications-v1-01-05-replace-the-not-thr_dvrfz8k3w8`.\n\n## Summary\n\nAddressed the CI \"format check\" failure on PR #359: five files (`manifest.test.ts`, `moduleRegistryDriftCheck.test.ts`, `notify.test.ts`, `scheduler.test.ts`, `driftCheck.ts`) had whitespace/style that didn't match Prettier's formatting. Ran `prettier --write` on them — whitespace-only changes, no logic altered — and committed as `897f128`.\n\nVerified afterward: build (11 packages), `format:check`, lint, dependency-boundary check, unit tests (127/127), integration tests against real Postgres (815/815), and e2e tests (5/5) — all pass.\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
